{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Thai Shrimp Cake - Tod Mun Goong",
  "text": "Thai Shrimp Cake - Tod Mun Goong\n\nYield: 8\n\nStatus: Untried\n\nIngredients\n\n800g prawn,\n\n100g pork fat,\n\n1 egg white,\n\n1 tbsp tapioca flour,\n\n1½ tbsp light soy sauce,\n\n½ tsp sea salt,\n\n1 ½ tsp pepper,\n\n3 tbsp sesame oil,\n\n1 cup panko breadcrumbs,\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Clean prawns, shell, discard heads and tails, and devein without slitting back.\n\n2. Toss prawns in tapioca flour and wash under running water until clear.\n\n3. Pat dry with a paper towel and flatten each prawn with a cleaver.\n\n4. Put prawns in a mixing bowl and add pork fat, egg white, tapioca flour, soy sauce, salt and pepper. Knead to combine.\n\n5. Add sesame oil and continue kneading the mixture by throwing it against the side of the bowl until stiff.\n\n6. Refrigerate until very cold.\n\n7. Roll the prawn mixture into a donut shape (about 80 grams each) and coat with breadcrumbs.\n\n8. Deep fry until golden.\n\n9 Remove from oil and drain on kitchen towels.",
  "recipeYield": "8",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "800g prawn,",
    "100g pork fat,",
    "1 egg white,",
    "1 tbsp tapioca flour,",
    "1½ tbsp light soy sauce,",
    "½ tsp sea salt,",
    "1 ½ tsp pepper,",
    "3 tbsp sesame oil,",
    "1 cup panko breadcrumbs,"
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Clean prawns, shell, discard heads and tails, and devein without slitting back."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Toss prawns in tapioca flour and wash under running water until clear."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Pat dry with a paper towel and flatten each prawn with a cleaver."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Put prawns in a mixing bowl and add pork fat, egg white, tapioca flour, soy sauce, salt and pepper. Knead to combine."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Add sesame oil and continue kneading the mixture by throwing it against the side of the bowl until stiff."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "6. Refrigerate until very cold."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "7. Roll the prawn mixture into a donut shape (about 80 grams each) and coat with breadcrumbs."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "8. Deep fry until golden."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "9 Remove from oil and drain on kitchen towels."
    }
  ],
